      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-72120\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">1.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/1979#6102\">Identifying Type II Regions</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"72120\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Which of the following is a type II region in two-dimensional space?</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Mon, Oct 12th @ 3:00 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:21</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
