?</p>\n<ol class=\"questionStatements\"><li>  It is a type I region </li><li>  It is a type II region </li><li>  It's neither a type I nor a type II region </li></ol></div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Mon, Oct 12th @ 3:01 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:10</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>",
